# Goal for the DSP global planner.
# The position is used for path planning. The orientation is ignored by DSP and is
# forwarded to ego-planner on every goal published on /move_base_simple/goal.
# An empty frame_id means the planner frame (odom_frame_id); any other frame is
# transformed into it with TF.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped goal
---
# false if the goal could not be accepted (e.g. TF transform failed)
bool success
string message
